						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Thursday, September 19, 2002</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">Hub Bub Around The Web </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							Well, there is some stirring happening all over the web.<BR><BR><a href=http://eq.crgaming.com/>Casters Realm</a><BR><BR>kind of started the mass flocking to a specific thread after it was brought to Alan Crosby's attention.  Crosby is the Customer Service Manager for EverQuest Games.  The thread on a Solusek Ro Server Guild Forum has received mass response from many other EQ players.<BR><BR>The title of the thread is<BR><BR><a href=http://pub95.ezboard.com/fbattleforgedfrm1.showMessage?topicID=207.topic>What Sony Doesn't Want You To Know</a>.<BR><BR>Just thought I would enlighten you all to the hub bub happening.
							<br><BR>
							 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=314">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
